return {
    ["\n亲爱的朋友们：\n　　你们读到这行字时，我大概正趴在甲板上抢救被狂暴海的巨浪打翻的芒果青柠酱。\n　　很高兴地告诉大家，我战时的灵感“黑麦朗姆弹壳泡芙”已经找到了绝佳的制作材料——因蒂斯南部的褐色李子，它们的甜度正好能中和朗姆的苦涩。\n　　我不久后就会回到鲁恩，真想快点将这一路上的冒险故事分享给你们！\n　　备注：如果邮差送来草垛扎着的木箱，请不要打开——那八成是我从某个岛上找到的变异蘑菇，能挤出牛奶，真是太神奇了。"] = "\nDear friends:\n　　By the time you read this, I am likely sprawled on the deck, desperately trying to save the mango-lime sauce that was overturned by the giant waves of the Berserk Sea.\n　　I am happy to tell you all that I have finally found the perfect ingredient for my wartime inspiration, the 'Rye Rum Shell Puff'—brown plums from southern Intis. Their sweetness is just enough to neutralize the bitterness of the rum.\n　　I will be returning to Loen soon, and I can't wait to share the adventure stories from this journey with you!\n　　Note: If the postman delivers a wooden crate tied with straw, please do not open it—it is most likely a mutated mushroom I found on some island. It can be squeezed to produce milk; it's truly magical.",
    [" <DecH>工艺：</>刺绣锦缎・花簇繁饰\n没人能断言绽放需要多长的等待，但绽放至半的美好已足以让人珍惜。"] = " <DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Embroidered Brocade · Flower Cluster Embellishments\nNo one can assert how long the wait for blooming takes, but the beauty of half-blooming is enough to be cherished.",
