    ["<Assistant_Title1>【提摩西兔】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得提摩西兔，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Timothy Rabbit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Timothy Rabbit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>预言之物</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在序章主线中，找齐三个预言之物，激活献祭仪式。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Prophecy Item</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Reality Main Story\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>In the prologue main story, find all three prophecy items to activate the Sacrifice Ritual.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n歌剧魅影搭配阶段已经结束，稍后即将开启正式比赛，欢迎前往魅影长廊进行观看。\n调整阶段已开启，会长/副会长还可通过调整顺序提升队伍的胜率，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250321\">前往调整</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe Phantom Corridor matching phase has ended. The official competition will begin shortly; you are welcome to go to the Phantom Corridor to watch. \nThe adjustment phase has begun. The President/Vice President can still increase the team's win rate by adjusting the order. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250321\">Go to adjust</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这么直白地说出来了？不是说鲁恩人都很含蓄吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Did they just say that so directly? Aren't Loen people supposed to be very reserved?)</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>召唤次数获取</>\n可通过以下方式获得召唤次数：\n<Highlight>每日刷新</>：每日可获得【灾异先锋】、【命运人偶】各1次召唤次数；\n<Highlight>领取猎杀进度奖励</>：解锁猎杀进度档位并领取奖励，可额外获得召唤次数。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重置规则</>\n召唤次数<Highlight>可在当周累积</>，每周一<Highlight>早上8:00</>统一重置。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Summon Counts</>\nYou can obtain summon counts in the following ways:\n<Highlight>Daily Refresh</>: You can obtain 1 summon count each for [Calamity Vanguard] and [Fate Marionette] daily;\n<Highlight>Claiming Hunt Progress Rewards</>: Unlock hunt progress tiers and claim rewards to obtain additional summon counts.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reset Rules</>\nSummon counts<Highlight> can be accumulated during the current week</> and will be uniformly reset every Monday at <Highlight>8:00 AM</>.\n",
