    ["他是我最佩服的小众诗人。他的作品平实而感人，可惜能欣赏的人太少了……这个浮躁的世界！"] = "He is the niche poet I admire most. His works are plain and moving, but unfortunately, too few people can appreciate them... this restless world!",
