    ["健康游戏忠告： 抵制不良游戏，拒绝盗版游戏。注意自我保护，谨防受骗上当。适度游戏益脑，沉迷游戏伤身。合理安排时间，享受健康生活。\n本游戏适合年满16周岁以上（未成年人请在家长陪同下体验）的用户使用。本公司积极履行《网络游戏行业防沉迷自律公约》。 \n根据国家新闻出版署 《关于防止未成年人沉迷网络游戏的通知》和《关于进一步严格管理 切实防止未成年人沉迷网络游戏的通知》，所有用户必须使用本人身份信息进行实名登记，未成年人将纳入防沉迷限制。\n著作权人：杭州弹指宇宙科技有限公司 运营单位：杭州弹指宇宙网络有限公司 出版单位：上海文艺音像电子出版社有限公司 批准文号：国新出审[2024]659号 出版物号：ISBN 978-7-498-13290-1 ICP备案号：<Underline>浙ICP备2024115807号-3A</>"] = "Healthy Gaming Advice: Resist harmful games, refuse pirated games. Protect yourself and beware of scams. Moderate gaming is good for the brain, while addiction is harmful to the body. Arrange your time reasonably and enjoy a healthy life. \n This game is suitable for users aged 16 and above (minors should be accompanied by parents). Our company actively fulfills the \"Online Game Industry Anti-Addiction Self-Discipline Convention\". \n According to the \"Notice on Preventing Minors from Becoming Addicted to Online Games\" and the \"Notice on Further Strictly Managing and Effectively Preventing Minors from Becoming Addicted to Online Games\" issued by the National Press and Publication Administration, all users must use their personal identity information for real-name registration, and minors will be subject to anti-addiction restrictions. \n Copyright Holder: Hangzhou Danzhi Universe Technology Co., Ltd. Operator: Hangzhou Danzhi Universe Network Co., Ltd. Publisher: Shanghai Literature and Art Audio-Visual Electronic Publishing House Co., Ltd. Approval Number: Guo Xin Chu Shen [2024] No. 659 Publication Number: ISBN 978-7-498-13290-1 ICP Filing Number: <Underline> Zhe ICP Bei 2024115807 Hao-3A </>",
    ["偷听了侦探与占卜师的交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">角色的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">侦探的助手抢走了占卜师的道具，并在路口死死缠住了开膛手。</>\n与侦探交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">时间的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">当前无人的“夜晚”是被剧本篡改的，正确的舞台时间应是黄昏。</>\n\n经过推理，知道了这一幕的真相是：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">在黄昏之下，侦探的助手借着表演的名义拦住了开膛手，从而解救了少女。</>"] = "Eavesdropped on the conversation between the detective and the diviner, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> character </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The detective's assistant snatched the diviner's prop and held the Ripper fast at the intersection. </>\nCommunicated with the detective, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> time </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The current deserted \"night\" was tampered with by the script; the correct stage time should be dusk. </>\n\nAfter reasoning, the truth of this scene is: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">At dusk, the detective's assistant blocked the Ripper under the guise of a performance, thereby rescuing the young girl. </>",
